{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Adventures Of Bryan Scott",
    "steam_appid": 1926720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926720/extras/1c216f501af5f5b3ce3bd96017c7eb2b.avif?t=1753573866\" data-has-big /></div><strong>A journey to North Africa. An ancient legend. And a secret that changes everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bryan Scott leads an ordinary and uneventful life \u2013 until a mysterious package from North Africa turns everything upside down. Inside: the diary of the missing treasure hunter Kate Williams and a clue to the legendary treasure of the Queen of Sheba.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What begins as a search for a missing woman soon becomes much more: On his journey, Bryan encounters dark secrets, a dangerous secret society \u2013 and traces of his deceased father, who once chased the same myth but never found answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey full of puzzles, intrigue, and adventure \u2013 but also full of hope, the past, and the chance to complete his father's legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can expect a lovingly hand-drawn point-and-click adventure full of charm, humor, clever dialogue, and challenging puzzles \u2013 inspired by classics like <i>Broken Sword</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn, high-resolution backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional frame-by-frame animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric orchestral soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-use one-click interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full voice-over in English and German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subtitles and interface in English and German</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Featuring voices by Rolf Saxon &amp; Alexander Schottky, known from <i>Broken Sword</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926720/extras/1c216f501af5f5b3ce3bd96017c7eb2b.avif?t=1753573866\" data-has-big /></div><strong>A journey to North Africa. An ancient legend. And a secret that changes everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bryan Scott leads an ordinary and uneventful life \u2013 until a mysterious package from North Africa turns everything upside down. Inside: the diary of the missing treasure hunter Kate Williams and a clue to the legendary treasure of the Queen of Sheba.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What begins as a search for a missing woman soon becomes much more: On his journey, Bryan encounters dark secrets, a dangerous secret society \u2013 and traces of his deceased father, who once chased the same myth but never found answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey full of puzzles, intrigue, and adventure \u2013 but also full of hope, the past, and the chance to complete his father's legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can expect a lovingly hand-drawn point-and-click adventure full of charm, humor, clever dialogue, and challenging puzzles \u2013 inspired by classics like <i>Broken Sword</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn, high-resolution backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional frame-by-frame animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric orchestral soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-use one-click interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full voice-over in English and German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subtitles and interface in English and German</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Featuring voices by Rolf Saxon &amp; Alexander Schottky, known from <i>Broken Sword</i></strong></p>",
